"""Transformed features for the location family would be deterministic reshapes of the raw parcel data to its native grain — pivoting, deduplication, or standardising geometry — where two engineers would independently produce the identical output. The location source already arrives at the parcel grain and the pipeline moves straight to the exploratory-analysis-chosen growth definitions (the growth-signal rules, the quarter-mile count radius, the hotspot thresholds, and the H3 resolutions), so those live in the engineered layer and this transform layer is intentionally empty."""
